                                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                    android:layout_height="300dp"
                                    android:src="@drawable/sakib"
                                    android:scaleType="fitXY"
                                    />
                                <TextView
                                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                    android:textStyle="bold"
                                    android:text="Sakib Al Hasasn "
                                    android:textSize="30sp"
                                    android:layout_marginLeft="5dp"
                                    />

                                <TextView
                                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                    android:layout_marginLeft="5dp"
                                    android:text="Left handed  all rounder "
                                    android:textColor="#136521"
                                    android:textSize="18sp"
                                    android:textStyle="bold" />

                                <TextView
                                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                    android:textStyle="normal"
                                    android:text="Since 2004, Shakib has played for Khulna in the National Cricket League.

In 2004–05 season of the tournament, Shakib, since his debut in May 2004 at the age of 17, played just 3 matches.[b] He scored 129 runs at an average of 25.80 with a high score of 54 and took 16 wickets at an average of 27.87 with a best bowling figure of 6/79 in an innings and 9/114 in a match.[32]

In the 2006–07 season, he played just 2[c] matches scoring 51 runs at an average 17.00 with a high score of 23. He bowled only in 1 innings where he bowled 4 overs of 9 runs with 1 maiden over without any wicket.[33]

Shakib has played 14 matches scoring 933 runs at an average of 40.43 with three 100s and a high score of 129.[34] He also got 31 wickets at an average of 33.16 with 1 5-wicket haul.[35]"
                                    android:textSize="15sp"
                                    android:layout_marginLeft="5dp"
                                    android:textColor="#0E6671"
                                    android:gravity="left"
                                    />


                            </LinearLayout>

                        </androidx.cardview.widget.CardView>

                    </ScrollView>
                    <!--...........Sakib ......-->

