                       Tamim was the more talented one.
                     When Tamim was 12 or 13, he hit 148 as the team chased 150"
                                android:textSize="15sp"
                                android:layout_marginLeft="5dp"
                                android:textColor="#0E6671"
                                android:gravity="left"
                                />

                        </LinearLayout>


                    </ScrollView>
                    <!--.......Liton Das ......-->

                    <!--........Soumma  Das ......-->
                    <ScrollView
                        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        >


                        <LinearLayout
                            android:id="@+id/Soumma_L"
                            android:layout_width="match_parent"
                            android:layout_height="match_parent"
                            android:orientation="vertical"
                            android:visibility="gone"
                            >
                            <ImageView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="300dp"
                                android:src="@drawable/soumma"
                                android:scaleType="fitXY"
                                />
                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:textStyle="bold"
                                android:text="Soumma Sarker "
                                android:textSize="30sp"
                                android:layout_marginLeft="5dp"
                                />


                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:layout_marginLeft="5dp"
                                android:text="Right handed  batter "
                                android:textColor="#136521"
                                android:textSize="18sp"
                                android:textStyle="bold" />

                            <TextView
                                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                                android:textStyle="normal"
                                android:text="Since 2004, Shakib has played for Khulna in the National Cricket League.

